1
00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:44.750
Then he told this parable.

2
00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:48.350
A man had a fig tree growing in his vineyard,

3
00:00:49.050 --> 00:00:52.350
and he went to look for fruit on it but did not find any.

4
00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:55.550
So he said to the man who took care of the vineyard,

5
00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:59.500
For three years now I've been coming to look for fruit on this fig tree

6
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:01.300
and haven't found any.

7
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:05.050
Cut it down! Why should it use up the soil?

8
00:01:06.150 --> 00:01:07.850
Sir, the man replied,

9
00:01:08.550 --> 00:01:10.350
leave it alone for one more year,

10
00:01:10.850 --> 00:01:12.950
and I'll dig around it and fertilize it.

11
00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:15.550
If it bears fruit next year, fine!

12
00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:18.000
If not, then cut it down.
